{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/r2x472tk","slide":1,"text":"DS4 原始路线围绕 Apple unified memory + Metal kernel 组织，底层算子和数据流天然贴合苹果执行栈。","textPreview":"DS4 原始路线围绕 Apple unified memory + Metal kernel 组织，底层算子和数据流天然贴合苹果执行栈。","textChars":68,"textLines":1,"bbox":[160,125,564,22]}
