{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/47a5w721","slide":1,"text":"我们需要可控的 profile、cache policy、服务化接口和后续在线部署能力，这要求运行时必须完全可改、可测、可演进。","textPreview":"我们需要可控的 profile、cache policy、服务化接口和后续在线部署能力，这要求运行时必须完全可改、可测、可演进。","textChars":64,"textLines":1,"bbox":[160,293,564,22]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/58j6pcj6","slide":1,"text":"•","textPreview":"•","textChars":1,"textLines":1,"bbox":[788,118,16,19.5]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/f258v6lo","slide":1,"text":"不能只做“Metal kernel → CUDA kernel”的语法级替换；真正要迁移的是 streamed-MoE 的控制面思想。","textPreview":"不能只做“Metal kernel → CUDA kernel”的语法级替换；真正要迁移的是 streamed-MoE 的控制面思想。","textChars":67,"textLines":1,"bbox":[804,118,460,21.5]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/e1c7ml43","slide":1,"text":"•","textPreview":"•","textChars":1,"textLines":1,"bbox":[788,172,16,19.5]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/14nqxg3e","slide":1,"text":"必须把冷数据读取、expert cache、decode scheduler、service interface 全部从苹果黑盒依赖中解耦出来。","textPreview":"必须把冷数据读取、expert cache、decode scheduler、service interface 全部从苹果黑盒依赖中解耦出来。","textChars":72,"textLines":1,"bbox":[804,172,460,21.5]}
